config DMA_TI_TM4C
	bool "TI TM4C uDMA controller driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_TI_TIVA_C_UDMA_ENABLED
	select USE_TIVAWARE_UDMA
	select USE_TIVAWARE_SYSCTL
	help
	  DMA driver for the micro DMA controller (uDMA) of TI TM4C
	  (Tiva C) microcontrollers. Channels 0..29 are hardwired to
	  peripheral request signals; channel 30 serves software
	  (memory to memory) requests. The driver reports completions
	  of software channels through the controller's own interrupt;
	  peripheral channels complete in the owning peripheral's
	  interrupt and are polled by their drivers.
